# .dockerignore
# Keep the build context small and secret-free. The Dockerfiles COPY only
# package*.json, tsconfig.json, src/ and mocks/ — nothing below is needed, and
# .env must never reach a build context (it holds gateway credentials).

node_modules
dist
coverage
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
observability
docs
projectSpec
tests
